        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right."
      },
      {
        "text": "It stopped working when Player was discontinued",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Its guests still start."
      },
      {
        "text": "It became Workstation Pro by itself",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "Nothing upgrades it."
      },
      {
